## II. The canonical map onto the whole exact region

Forward: 20000 uniform q -> 100.000% physical. Completeness: of 1000 points drawn uniformly in P, 992 are reproduced to 1e-6 (max residual 6.1e-03).
Non-uniformity: uniform q puts 1.1% of draws in the w-simplex (volume share 13.1%) and 4.6% in S* (volume share 9.0%).

